{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/cygwin' data-target='computer\/os\/cygwin' data-title='Cygwin'>\r\n\t\t\tCygwin\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Point Cygwin home at the Windows user profile by setting db_home in /etc/nsswitch.conf.","label":"Cygwin home","prevArticle":null,"nextArticle":null,"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCygwin home is not the Windows user profile by default. Set <code class='inline'>db_home<\/code> in <code class='inline'>\/etc\/nsswitch.conf<\/code> so Cygwin uses the Windows home directory.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\thttp:\/\/stackoverflow.com\/questions\/1494658\/how-can-i-change-my-cygwin-home-folder-after-installation\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>nsswitch.conf<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIn <code class='inline'>\/etc\/nsswitch.conf<\/code>:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>db_home: &lt;dir&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tValues:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>windows\n\/%H\n\/%H\/cygwin<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>windows<\/code> uses the Windows home. <code class='inline'>\/%H<\/code> is that home path. <code class='inline'>\/%H\/cygwin<\/code> puts Cygwin home under a <code class='inline'>cygwin<\/code> subdirectory of Windows home.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/cygwin\/set_windows_home_as_home\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/cygwin\/set_windows_home_as_home\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/os\/cygwin' data-target='computer\/os\/cygwin' data-title='Cygwin'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/computer\/os\/cygwin.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Cygwin<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}